  <item>
    <title>EP13 跨城追剧：《牡丹亭》唤醒的除了杜丽娘，还有我们的”内心园林“</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69bb65282d318777c9a2d973</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69bb65282d318777c9a2d973</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 19 Mar 2026 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哼哈驾到，趣谈人生~本期是我们哼哈二绛的第十三期👏🏻</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌸春日早安！欢迎大家来到我们的第二季，感谢大家的耐心等候❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期以春日记忆与园林情结为引，我们围绕</span><strong><span>春天、园林、舞剧《牡丹亭》展开一场温柔而深刻的对谈。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>哈妹分享跨城追剧的震撼体验，从苏州园林的婉约意境、苏州博物馆的现代中式美学切入，细细拆解舞剧《牡丹亭》所带来的身心震撼。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们在对话中厘清：杜丽娘的内核从来不是 “恋爱脑”，而是</span><strong><span>自我意识觉醒与人性本真的解放</span></strong><span>。结合汤显祖的创作底色、昆曲与舞剧的传承创新，以及《牡丹亭》文本所承载的反抗精神，最终落点于：愿每个人都能在忙碌生活里，找到属于自己的</span><strong><span>内心园林</span></strong><span>，守住那份至情至性，让灵魂得以舒展与安放🌱</span></p><span></span><p><span>ps.作为戏曲文哲的门外汉，我们的分享仅为个人感受，如有不准确之处敬请谅解~</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hey~很高兴再相见~❤️</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frb5bI6gpKKaqQ8MGW4rcvXMgbaZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsI1WYhfUO0BI7jC2UvZqYbzdAOo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>——《舞剧牡丹亭》官方剧照</span></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Show Notes</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 哼哈二将第二季首期上线，恰逢春分 + 龙抬头，开启春日主题对谈</span></h3><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">06:05</a> 园林情结：“不到园林，怎知春色如许”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a> 苏州博物馆：贝聿铭用现代手法打造留白与水墨意境，向传统致敬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="984">16:24</a> 《牡丹亭》文化基因：窦文涛的"游园惊梦" vs. 白先勇的"青春版牡丹亭"</span></p><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1328">22:08</a> 观剧缘起：夏达漫画《游园惊梦》，《红楼梦》黛玉听戏，文学宇宙隔空共鸣</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1569">26:09</a> 视觉冲击，真的被“游园”美哭了</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2019">33:39</a> 神仙卡司</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2369">39:29</a> “女性觉醒”的共鸣：丽娘不是恋爱脑</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2658">44:18</a> 汤显祖的创作密码：童心说反对理学压抑，主张真情与人性解放</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2979">49:39</a> 舞剧的高级表达，张力拉满的“惊梦”</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3828">01:03:48</a> 春香也是礼教高墙里的一道光</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3984">01:06:24</a> 找寻属于自我的园林</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4115">01:08:35</a> 情不知所起，一往而深，生者可以死，死可以生</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>哼哈二绛的听友营地</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhKV5BWdUm7hvtvj6FPirpxKCyQE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>戳vx：hhej20241201（备注：哼哈二绛听友）</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>哪里可以找到我们</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>小宇宙 | 苹果播客 | 喜马拉雅 | 网易云音乐 | QQ音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>各平台同步更新</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>本期BGM源自网络</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Music: Amberlight by Scott Buckley </span></em><a href="https://www.scottbuckley.com.au/" data-url="https://www.scottbuckley.com.au/"><em><span>www.scottbuckley.com.au</span></em></a><em><span>/</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>License: Creative Commons — Attribution 4.0 International — CC BY 4.0</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Free Download / Stream: </span></em><a href="https://audiolibrary.com.co/scott-buckley/amberlight" data-url="https://audiolibrary.com.co/scott-buckley/amberlight"><em><span>audiolibrary.com.co</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><em><span>Music promoted by Audio Library: </span></em><a href="https://youtu.be/E1tPuvzM1IY" data-url="https://youtu.be/E1tPuvzM1IY"><em><span>youtu.be</span></em></a></p>]]></description>
