    <title>EP05 救命！原来留学规划要这么玩‼️ 是时候投资认知觉醒了💰</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67bbd4a0606e5c5940645c9d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67bbd4a0606e5c5940645c9d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 24 Feb 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哼哈驾到，趣谈人生~本期是我们哼哈二绛的第五期👏🏻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客邀请了一位好朋友-启思逐梦的留学指导老师Eddie（张鹏）。我们围绕</span><strong><span>留学规划</span></strong><span>展开，探讨了留学的意义、规划时间点、目标国家与学校选择、专业规划以及留学对个人成长的影响。</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论留学与否，愿大家都能走上各自的灵魂归途。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hey~早上好~❤️</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>Show Notes</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="102">01:42</a></span></strong><span> Eddie老师分享自己从荷兰留学回国后进入高盛工作的经历。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="181">03:01</a></span></strong><span> 哈妹分享自己在英国谢菲尔德大学留学的经历。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="459">07:39</a></span></strong><span> Eddie老师讨论国内外教育资源分配差异。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">09:16</a></span></strong><span> Eddie老师分享留学规划的时间点和重要性。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a></span></strong><span> Eddie老师介绍全球留学目的地的梯队划分。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1189">19:49</a></span></strong><span> 哼姐询问留学申请的具体流程。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1299">21:39</a></span></strong><span>Eddie老师分享一个孩子从7岁开始养蜥蜴，最终被康奈尔大学录取的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1434">23:54</a></span></strong><span> 哈妹分享自己选择英国留学的原因。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1919">31:59</a></span></strong><span> 哈妹分享英国留学对学术思维的重塑。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2101">35:01</a></span></strong><span> Eddie老师讨论GRE考试对留学申请的影响。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2565">42:45</a></span></strong><span> 哈妹分享英国留学生活中的感悟。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2839">47:19</a></span></strong><span> Eddie老师讨论留学经历对回国工作的帮助。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3020">50:20</a></span></strong><span> 哼姐询问留学的经济成本。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3073">51:13</a></span></strong><span> Eddie老师介绍美国留学的学费和生活成本。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3187">53:07</a></span></strong><span> 哈妹分享自己的留学费用和对留学价值的看法。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3358">55:58</a></span></strong><span> Eddie老师强调留学带来的校友圈资源的重要性。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3529">58:49</a></span></strong><span> Eddie老师讨论未来留学热门专业。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3679">01:01:19</a></span></strong><span> Eddie老师分享留学规划中家长和孩子的决策比例。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>想找</span><strong><span>Eddie</span></strong><span>老师了解有关</span><strong><span>留学</span></strong><span>信息的友友可以扫描下方二维码，添加小助手时注明“</span><strong><span>哼哈二绛</span></strong><span>”：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmpI5Gy-l_AN8oyLkkZSgOxCF58B.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>哼哈二绛的听友营地</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm58BkywEZjBR0suOpihJnhTb6DT.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>戳vx：hhej20241201（备注：哼哈二绛听友）</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>哪里可以找到我们</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>小宇宙 | 苹果播客 | 喜马拉雅 | 网易云音乐 | QQ音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>各平台同步更新</span></p>]]></description>
